  "releaseNotes": "0.2.0: two more message types and the rest of the Messaging API surface. TemplateMessage models the four templates (buttons, confirm, carousel, image_carousel) and ImagemapMessage the imagemap with its uri and message areas and optional video; their action and column caps (4 / exactly 2 / 10 columns of at most 3 matching actions / 50 areas) are checked locally before anything is sent. Every message can now carry a sender override (name, iconUrl); VideoMessage takes a trackingId and the webhook parser reads videoPlayComplete.trackingId back. New endpoints: the follower list, group and room summary, member count, member ids, member profile and leave, the loading animation (5 to 60 seconds in steps of 5, checked locally), mark-as-read, the five message validation endpoints, narrowcast with progress tracking (the request id comes from the X-Line-Request-Id header), upload audiences (create, add members, read, list, delete) and the three insight endpoints (message delivery, followers, demographics). Every response model carries explicit JsonPropertyName attributes. New error codes: line.validation.invalid_template, invalid_imagemap, invalid_loading_seconds, invalid_page_size and too_many_audience_members; existing codes and categories are unchanged. See https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.Line/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
